  ['已导入{0}个，更新{1}个', 'Imported {0}, updated {1}'],
  ['已更新{0}个 Steam 令牌凭据', 'Updated credentials for {0} Steam token(s)'],
  ['Steam 令牌', 'Steam Token'],
  ['本应用提供 Steam 相关辅助功能，仅用于帮助用户管理个人验证信息及提升使用体验。本应用与 Valve、Steam 官方不存在隶属、授权或合作关系。', 'This app provides supporting Steam features only to help users manage their own authentication information. It is not affiliated with, authorized by, or partnered with Valve or Steam.'],
  ['登录过程中，账号认证请求由用户设备直接与 Steam 官方服务进行通信，登录成功后会实时删除账号密码等敏感信息。本应用不会收集、上传或存储用户的 Steam 密码、登录验证码等敏感信息。', 'During sign-in, authentication requests go directly from your device to Steam services. Passwords and other sensitive data are deleted immediately after sign-in. This app does not collect, upload, or store Steam passwords or sign-in codes.'],
  ['生成的验证配置文件默认仅保存在本地设备中。若开启华为云备份功能，将采用加密方式保存相关配置数据到华为云空间，用于设备迁移或恢复使用。请妥善保管备份文件及恢复信息，避免因泄露导致账号安全风险。', 'Generated authenticator profiles stay on this device by default. If Huawei Cloud backup is enabled, related configuration data is encrypted and stored in Huawei Cloud for migration or recovery. Protect backups and recovery information to avoid account risks.'],
  ['请确保仅在本人授权的 Steam 账号上使用本功能，并从可信来源安装应用。因账号、设备或备份信息管理不当造成的风险，请用户自行承担。', 'Use this feature only with Steam accounts you are authorized to manage and install the app from a trusted source. You are responsible for risks caused by improper account, device, or backup management.'],
  ['需打开网络代理，登录凭证加密后通过 https 通道直接发送 Steam 官方服务 api.steampowered.com，不会进行任何第三方中转；成功发起登录后账号密码敏感信息会立即删除。', 'A network proxy is required. Encrypted credentials are sent directly over HTTPS to the official Steam service at api.steampowered.com without third-party relays. Sensitive account and password data is deleted as soon as sign-in begins successfully.'],
  ['在完成前不要删除刚生成的本地令牌；它包含避免账号锁定所需的密钥和恢复码。', 'Do not delete the newly generated local token before finishing. It contains the secret and recovery code needed to avoid account lockout.'],
  ['请立即保存恢复码。恢复码用于验证器丢失时恢复账号，关闭后仍可从导出的 maFile 中备份，但不建议只保留一份。', 'Save the recovery code now. It can recover the account if the authenticator is lost. You can also back it up from an exported maFile later, but keeping only one copy is not recommended.'],
  ['此 maFile 由 Steam Desktop Authenticator 加密。请输入 SDA 的加密密码，密码只用于本机解密，不会保存。', 'This maFile is encrypted by Steam Desktop Authenticator. Enter the SDA encryption password. It is used only for local decryption and is not saved.'],
  ['可以登录一个尚未启用 Steam 移动验证器的账号并在本机生成 maFile，也可以导入已有的完整 maFile。', 'Sign in to an account without Steam Mobile Authenticator to generate a maFile locally, or import an existing complete maFile.'],
  ['如对本协议或本应用有疑问，可发送邮件至 {0}。', 'For questions about this agreement or app, email {0}.'],
  ['我知道了', 'Got It'],
  ['当前账号已存在验证器，请直接导入原maFile文；如果原文件已丢失，请先在Steam官方应用中移除旧验证器，再返回此处重新生成验证器。', 'This account already has an authenticator. Import the original maFile. If it is lost, remove the old authenticator in the official Steam app before generating a new one here.'],
  ['验证码已提交。如果 Steam 尚未签发登录令牌，请稍等片刻后再次检查。', 'The code was submitted. If Steam has not issued a sign-in token yet, wait a moment and check again.'],
  ['Steam 已向账号绑定邮箱发送验证码。', 'Steam sent a code to the email address linked to the account.'],
  ['请输入现有 Steam 移动验证器显示的 5 位代码。', 'Enter the 5-character code shown by the existing Steam Mobile Authenticator.'],
  ['请打开 Steam 邮件并确认这次登录，然后返回继续。', 'Open the Steam email and confirm this sign-in, then return to continue.'],
  ['请在已登录的 Steam 移动应用中批准这次登录，然后返回继续。', 'Approve this sign-in in the signed-in Steam mobile app, then return to continue.'],
  ['Steam 已向账号绑定邮箱发送激活验证码，请输入后完成添加。', 'Steam sent an activation code to the email address linked to the account. Enter it to finish adding the authenticator.'],
